Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:14.45,Main,MERL,0,0,0,,Please, Gio, these humans saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.11,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:20.55,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan, we seem to have \Nentered an elf forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:22.61,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:25.82,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,We didn't come here to fight, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:29.52,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Still, you two should get \Nbehind me just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:35.25,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,My human and lamia friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:40.06,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Firstly, let me express my gratitude for \Nthe help you provided our friend Merl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:41.72,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:50.12,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,But Ente belongs to us forest dwellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:53.37,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Why have you set foot in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:29.00,Ep_Title,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\fad(875,0)}Visitors from the Dark
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.52,0:02:31.95,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'm Dolan, from Verun Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:36.75,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Some disturbing monsters have started \Nappearing in the vicinity of our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.75,0:02:41.67,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,We surmised that something was going on \Nin the forest and came to investigate,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.67,0:02:44.60,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,but I realize now that we should've \Nasked for your permission first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:45.51,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I apologize for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:51.90,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,I see. I cannot blame you for \Ncoming here for such a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:55.55,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,But I will suggest that you leave, at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:03:00.60,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Because this forest is currently \Nin an extremely perilous state.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:03.90,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Are you talking about the demon troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:09.74,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I see. So they've appeared \Nin your village, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:14.26,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,"Appeared" doesn't begin to describe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:19.21,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,We're currently waging war against \Nthe demon army in this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:24.17,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Wait! How are you dealing with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:26.36,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Do you have enough forces?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.67,0:03:29.57,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Have you reported this \Nemergency to the kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:32.51,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Is your village truly safe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:35.62,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Christina!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:37.25,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.25,0:03:40.15,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Look, the elves seem troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.15,0:03:42.57,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Even one of that bizarre \Ncreature is dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:45.52,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,and there's a whole army of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:51.33,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Tell me, is your village not in \Nextreme danger as we speak?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:54.83,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,If there is anything we can \Ndo to help, we'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.13,0:04:07.96,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Oh, forgive me. I lost my composure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.30,0:04:11.12,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,It's not a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.12,0:04:14.88,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,You're worried for the elves, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:19.23,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Merl, those humans seem nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.23,0:04:22.69,Main,MERL,0,0,0,,They are. What's more, \Nthey even beat the demon soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:27.88,Main,ELFA,0,0,0,,Yeah, that human girl seems to \Nhave real skill with the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:32.70,Main,ELFB,0,0,0,,Right. And it looks like \Nthat lamia likes them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:34.84,Main,ELFB,0,0,0,,Maybe we can trust them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:39.18,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Chris's strength of character \Nis helping us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:42.58,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,But did they say "demon army"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:48.47,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,If those zerts earlier didn't just \Nhappen to wander onto the surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.47,0:04:53.51,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,that must mean there's a portal connecting \Nthe demonic realm to this Forest of Ente.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:58.94,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Should the portal open fully, even \Nstronger demons will come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:03.85,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,No... I'll destroy them \Nbefore it comes to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:10.58,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Even if people find out that I have a \Ndragon soul and I'm chased out of my home,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.09,0:05:14.87,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I have to use my dragon \Npowers without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:17.87,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I have a proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:23.50,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,As she just said, this is an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:27.38,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,It isn't something you \Ncan handle on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:33.13,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,This may violate your laws, but would \Nyou allow us to help you temporarily?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:34.79,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:40.44,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.71,0:05:41.53,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Fio?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:44.92,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,I understand your \Nresponsibilities as our leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:49.12,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,But I care more about our \Nfellow villagers than our laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:54.01,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,I think these people are speaking in \Ngood faith. Let's try trusting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:03.34,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:06.42,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Please, my human friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:09.18,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Lend us your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:14.69,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,But, knowing that you can hold your own, \NI'll surely begin to rely on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:18.55,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,even though it may put your lives in peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.53,0:06:23.22,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,And we're saying that's fine by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:27.32,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,I'm Gio, brave human boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.73,0:06:30.29,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Dolan. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:34.25,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:38.78,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan... What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:48.42,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,This sensation...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:52.00,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I recognize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:56.28,Italics,DOLAN,0,0,0,,A portal has opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.49,0:07:31.79,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,To the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.27,0:07:35.77,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Hear me, O laws of wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:39.06,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Give us a tailwind to boost our travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:41.05,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Wind Accel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:48.96,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,A wind support magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:51.24,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,It should help us hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.25,0:08:03.20,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Huh... so this is the surface.\N Not too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.53,0:08:10.32,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,So that our demonic ruler might \Nobtain the Ente Yggdrasil,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:13.22,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,we shall serve as the vanguard \Nthat clears the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:14.75,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:18.24,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,It is a clear display of his trust in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:21.23,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,We need to repay it by doing \Nour jobs as mercenaries!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:23.74,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Where is Georg?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.43,0:08:30.23,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Not here yet. His stupid amount of \Nmana's probably slowing him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.22,0:08:35.23,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, let's play a \Nlittle game before he shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:38.48,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I can sense the elves nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.48,0:08:41.74,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,How about we see who can find them first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:46.78,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,If I find them first, I'm free to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:49.05,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,That's the prize!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:52.40,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I'm in. Gellen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:55.10,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,I have no interest in weaklings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:57.63,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,I'm only here to fulfill \Nmy mission to the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.63,0:09:00.77,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Hmph! Well, I'm gonna raise some hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.05,0:09:03.77,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Starting with those trees there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:07.26,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Such an impatient fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:10.71,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,This place smells nice, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:15.56,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,The lovely fragrance of flowers... \NIt makes me want to show them some love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:29.61,Main,ELFF,0,0,0,,Damn these bugs! There's no end to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:31.56,Main,ELFG,0,0,0,,Don't let a single one into the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:35.62,Main,ELFF,0,0,0,,Wha... What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:45.74,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I am the first of the \NFour Demonic Knights, Geolude!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:49.82,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,My attack shall signal \Nthe declaration of war!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:04.88,Main,ELFF,0,0,0,,F-Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:23.72,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,What? Is that true, my spirit friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:29.50,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,The spirits are reporting that fiends \Nare attacking from north of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:32.52,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Dolan, these must be the\N higher-level demons you spoke of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:34.23,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,We need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.55,0:10:38.73,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Let's enter the village from the \Nsouthwest and fortify the defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:41.73,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.73,0:10:42.62,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:46.07,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Fight them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:55.50,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,You could handle the troops, \Nbut not a single blow from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.87,0:11:01.98,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Your screams just now were \Nmusic to my ears, elves!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:12.74,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,You can have the privilege of \Nwitnessing my spear once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:16.49,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:31.29,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.07,0:11:34.80,Main,ELFF,0,0,0,,R-Roses?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:37.82,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Quit spacing out and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:41.82,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,How vexing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:46.75,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Do you really believe mere vines \Ncan restrain the great Geolude?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.30,0:11:56.50,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Curses... They absorb my \Nblood and mana to bloom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:11:59.05,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Such loathsome black roses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:02.70,Main,ELFF,0,0,0,,Diadora...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:15.78,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,We're almost to the village! \NStay on your toes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.78,0:12:16.71,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.03,0:12:20.42,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I beseech thee, O laws of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:24.14,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Give me countless arrows to smite my foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.79,0:12:26.09,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Energy Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:51.10,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:12:58.56,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,We should buy some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.56,0:13:00.30,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,I was thinking the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:01.54,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.81,0:13:06.54,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Christina, Celina, let's use these \Nto cast some powerful spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.77,0:13:10.55,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Magic crystals? And pure ones, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.55,0:13:13.05,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Are these the ones we found at that swamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.91,0:13:16.25,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.76,0:13:18.07,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Use them as you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.45,0:13:22.53,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Heed my words, O laws of wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:27.11,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Allow me to bind and turn \Nyou into my blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.11,0:13:28.45,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Go wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.45,0:13:29.96,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Tornado!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:41.05,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,O spirits of earth, my foes are your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.05,0:13:44.02,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Sharpen thyself and be my spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:52.21,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I can't let them outdo me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.82,0:13:57.76,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Heed my words, O laws of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.76,0:14:02.41,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Come to me and gather, \Nand erupt into flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:04.04,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:16.74,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:24.72,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Those feats of strength make me \Nwant to rely on you even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:27.85,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,We wanted to show that you could rely on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.27,0:14:34.61,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Dweller of the demonic realm, do you \Nrealize the sins you have committed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.11,0:14:39.38,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,You left flora and insects \Ncrushed in your wake,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:44.56,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,killed animals, and took lives from \Nthose who call the forest their home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:48.32,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,You have committed too many sins to count!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:50.62,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Sins, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:55.93,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Perhaps you consider them sins, Diadora.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:59.09,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,But to me, being weak is a greater sin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.09,0:15:02.17,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,They were killed because they were weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.89,0:15:06.24,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,How you make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:11.52,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Enough. Your very words \Nare a blight on my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.91,0:15:15.85,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Allow me to inform you of \None another sin, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.36,0:15:18.22,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,You are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:25.11,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Your appearance \Nin this realm was one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:29.12,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Perish, filthy demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:33.13,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You played around too much, Geo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.05,0:15:40.08,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Wow, you really held Geo down?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:42.78,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You must have really powerful \Nmana, rose spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.49,0:15:47.38,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,How lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:49.61,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.61,0:15:54.17,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I'm one of the\N Four Demonic Knights, Raflasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.49,0:15:57.58,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Let's play nice, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:04.63,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:05.86,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:11.14,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,This is our elven village.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:13.70,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,But we have no time for sightseeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:15.03,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:20.15,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Hmph! I had no need for your help, Raflasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.15,0:16:22.32,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I could've handled that myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:25.19,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,My, such an obvious bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.19,0:16:31.33,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,But it is your role to charge ahead \Nand get into trouble, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:37.85,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,No, my role is to massacre \Nour foes before anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.85,0:16:40.95,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You're the only one who believes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:43.10,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.50,0:16:48.35,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Are you ready for a world of hurt,\N my black rose lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:51.69,Main,DIODORA,0,0,0,,Oh, you're teaming up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.69,0:16:56.04,Main,DIODORA,0,0,0,,Then I shall take you on \Nwith my friends, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.07,0:17:02.08,Italics,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Hear me, flora spirits of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:06.04,Italics,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Come to me and put on a show of strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:12.59,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Answer me, forest flora!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:20.45,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Wait, are you calling out \Nto these floral spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:24.96,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I saw a bunch of pretty \Nflowers on the way here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:28.16,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,and I just had to have some \Nfun with them, you see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.65,0:17:34.57,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,This lily spirit here \Nwithered away screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.43,0:17:42.34,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,And this gentian spirit was crying \Nfor help as it rotted away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:48.06,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,And the white lily spirits were \Nchopped to pieces by the zerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:50.68,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.92,0:17:55.29,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Oh, but the red roses were the \Nmost devoted of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:59.60,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,They cried, "Diadora! Please help, Diadora,"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:02.42,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,as I slowly cursed them to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.75,0:18:06.43,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.24,0:18:09.43,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,All those lives you took
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.43,0:18:12.93,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,belonged to my friends and family!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.93,0:18:15.18,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:19.41,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,So much anger, and for such a silly reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:23.71,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,All flowers fight over the \Nnutrients in the soil to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.71,0:18:26.91,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You should be glad that your \Ncompetition has dwindled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:34.83,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You know what? You should be \Nthanking me, if anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.29,0:18:39.12,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Silence! You will pay for what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:43.00,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Not a speck of you shall remain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:54.29,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You know, I'm a floral spirit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:08.10,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,But, unlike you, my flower isn't one \Nthat grows in the paradise up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:12.67,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I'm the spirit of a demonic realm flower \Nthat only feeds on blood and life,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:14.97,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,the raflaora!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:22.56,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,All life exists to feed my \Nblooming—they are but sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.21,0:19:24.97,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,As you now see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:27.48,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:33.65,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Insanity is doing the same thing \Nand expecting different results.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:42.40,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I thank you for the delicious food, \Njust as I did the other flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:44.71,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,You're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:51.53,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Gosh, will you ever learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:58.87,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:07.21,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,You're the one who needs to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.21,0:20:09.30,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,The prettier a rose, the sharper its thorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:13.50,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,People have said so forever. \NYou'd best commit it to memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:20.52,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.14,0:20:23.42,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,My blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.99,0:20:26.92,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You scarred me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:30.08,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Unthinkable! Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.75,0:20:36.33,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,How dare a lowly surface rose \Nspirit tarnish my beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:39.21,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You have committed the gravest of sins!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.21,0:20:40.75,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.75,0:20:44.16,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Your indignation is utterly \Nmeaningless, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.16,0:20:49.23,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I've decided to kill every last one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:56.48,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,This is tedious, Raflasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:21:00.16,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,I'll end this with one swing of my spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:04.98,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,Wait, Geo! She's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:06.73,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.58,0:21:15.40,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Don't think those vines will work on \Nme without the element of surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:18.50,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.41,0:21:25.02,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,You should flee more desperately...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.01,0:21:27.72,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,or this won't be any fun at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.07,0:21:37.74,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Wh-What? My mana's been absorbed...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.74,0:21:41.10,Main,RAFLASIA,0,0,0,,I'll bestow you a painless death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.22,0:21:44.78,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.07,0:21:51.42,Italics,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I can't die before I avenge \Nmy friends and family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.52,Italics,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:07.86,Main,GEOLUDE,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:19.48,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,A h-human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.99,0:24:00.00,Next_Episode,SIGN,0,0,0,,Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.85,0:24:07.87,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,This week's lucky item is magic crystals!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.87,0:24:09.75,Main,AIRI,0,0,0,,Look forward to next time!
